@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai API
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le (201 Created)
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200250",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ambrose-mas/EduSubmit-DTC245200250.git"
}

### 4. Nop bai loi: Thieu studentCode (400 Bad Request)
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ambrose-mas/EduSubmit-DTC245200250.git"
}

### 5. Nop bai loi: assignmentId khong hop le (400 Bad Request)
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": -1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200250",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ambrose-mas/EduSubmit-DTC245200250.git"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop khong ton tai (404 Not Found)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
